      "content": "but \"embracing mediocrity\" sounds like a joke. how am i supposed to just sit here and live for the next fifty years knowing i failed? i don't want to just \"be a person.\" i don't want to work a job i don't care about and watch the world pass me by. if you're being truly intellectually honest like you said... isn't there a point where it's more logical to just stop? if the potential is gone, what's actually left to defend?",
